@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = cole-aqui-o-accessToken

### Cadastro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Maria Silva", "email": "maria@email.com", "senha": "senha1234" }

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "maria@email.com", "senha": "senha1234" }

### Listar meus documentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documentos?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar envio (troque o id do documento; repita com a MESMA Idempotency-Key para ver o replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/envios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f1c9a52-6a0e-4c3b-9b1a-2f8e7d6c5b4a

{ "casoId": 1, "direitoCodigo": "CIPTEA", "documentoIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"] }

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
